#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:1
msgid "What is FlagOS-Compressor?"
msgstr "什么是 FlagOS-Compressor？"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor is a model-agnostic checkpoint conversion and "
"quantization tool for local [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) "
"`safetensors` model directories."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 是一个与模型无关的 checkpoint 转换和量化工具，用于本地 [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) `safetensors` 模型目录。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:5
msgid ""
"It sits between source checkpoint preparation and runtime inference "
"testing. It does not download models, train models, deploy services, or "
"decide whether a model is accurate enough for a business task."
msgstr "它位于源 checkpoint 准备与运行时推理测试之间。它不会下载模型、训练模型、部署服务，也不会判断模型精度是否足以满足业务任务。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:7
msgid "Problem it solves"
msgstr "解决的问题"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:9
msgid ""
"Large model checkpoints often need preparation before inference "
"experiments can begin. Source weights may be BF16, FP16, FP32, MXFP4, "
"block FP8, or a mixture of float and source-quantized tensors. Runtime "
"tests may require a BF16 baseline, a compressed-tensors artifact, or a "
"native GPTQ/AWQ layout."
msgstr "大型模型 checkpoint 通常需要先做准备，才能开始推理实验。源权重可能是 BF16、FP16、FP32、MXFP4、块 FP8，或浮点张量与源量化张量的混合。运行时测试可能需要 BF16 基线、compressed-tensors 构件，或原生 GPTQ/AWQ 布局。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:11
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor gives operators explicit control over that preparation "
"step:"
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 让操作者可以显式控制该准备步骤："

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:13
msgid "inspect the source checkpoint."
msgstr "检查源 checkpoint。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:14
msgid "convert recognized low-precision formats to BF16."
msgstr "将可识别的低精度格式转换为 BF16。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:15
msgid "quantize selected linear weights."
msgstr "量化选中的 Linear 权重。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:16
msgid "preserve unselected source-quantized weights as BF16."
msgstr "将未选中的源量化权重以 BF16 保留。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:17
msgid "write runtime-oriented output directories."
msgstr "写入面向运行时的输出目录。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:18
msgid "validate generated structure and metadata."
msgstr "验证生成的结构和元数据。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:20
msgid "Supported scope"
msgstr "支持范围"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:22
msgid "FlagOS-Compressor focuses on:"
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 主要关注："

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:24
msgid "MXFP4 and block FP8 to BF16 conversion."
msgstr "MXFP4 和块 FP8 到 BF16 的转换。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:25
msgid "MSE INT4 and INT8 quantization."
msgstr "MSE INT4 和 INT8 量化。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:26
msgid "W4A16, W8A16, and dynamic per-token W8A8 export."
msgstr "W4A16、W8A16 和动态逐 token W8A8 导出。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:27
msgid "GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound workflows."
msgstr "GPTQ、AWQ 和 AutoRound 工作流。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:28
msgid "Per-selector MSE W4A16, W8A16, and W8A8 policies in one execution."
msgstr "在一次执行中按选择器应用 MSE W4A16、W8A16 和 W8A8 策略。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:29
msgid ""
"Dense, standard MoE, supported fused MoE layouts, GLM-4 MoE, and "
"DeepSeek-V2/V3/V4 calibration structures."
msgstr "Dense、标准 MoE、受支持的融合 MoE 布局、GLM-4 MoE，以及 DeepSeek-V2/V3/V4 校准结构。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:30
msgid "compressed-tensors and native GPTQ/AWQ output validation."
msgstr "compressed-tensors 和原生 GPTQ/AWQ 输出验证。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:32
msgid "Outside the scope"
msgstr "范围之外"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:34
msgid "The tool does not handle:"
msgstr "该工具不处理："

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:36
msgid "model downloading."
msgstr "模型下载。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:37
msgid "model training or fine-tuning."
msgstr "模型训练或微调。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:38
msgid "automatic accuracy evaluation."
msgstr "自动精度评估。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:39
msgid "automatic inference kernel selection."
msgstr "自动推理内核选择。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:40
msgid "online service deployment."
msgstr "在线服务部署。"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:42
msgid "Where it fits"
msgstr "所处位置"

#: ../../source/explanation/what-is-flagos-compressor.md:53
msgid ""
"The output of FlagOS-Compressor is the starting point for runtime "
"testing, not the end of deployment qualification."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 的输出是运行时测试的起点，而不是部署资格验证的终点。"
